rrentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radio w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"><path d=\"M4.9 19.1C1 15.2 1 8.8 4.9 4.9\"></path><path d=\"M7.8 16.2c-2.3-2.3-2.3-6.1 0-8.5\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M16.2 7.8c2.3 2.3 2.3 6.1 0 8.5\"></path><path d=\"M19.1 4.9C23 8.8 23 15.1 19.1 19\"></path></svg><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight\">Viewer Side Live Command Center</h1></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium\">Control guest display features, watermarks, security locks, and live feed in real-time.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2 space-y-6\"><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#0b0f19] border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sliders-vertical w-4 h-4 text-pink-500\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"4\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"4\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"3\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"3\"></line><line x1=\"20\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"20\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"14\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"18\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg> Core Viewer Switches</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white\">Event Broadcast (isLive)</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">If OFF, viewers will see &#x27;Coming Soon&#x27;</p></div><button class=\"w-12 h-6 flex items-center rounded-full p-1 transition-colors duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-emerald-500\"><div class=\"bg-white w-4 h-4 rounded-full shadow-md transform transition-transform duration-200 translate-x-6\"></div></button></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white\">QR Code Direct Access</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Allow table standee scans</p></div><button class=\"w-12 h-6 flex items-center rounded-full p-1 transition-colors duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-pink-600\"><div class=\"bg-white w-4 h-4 rounded-full shadow-md transform transition-transform duration-200 translate-x-6\"></div></button></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white\">Guest Live Upload</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Let wedding guests upload selfies</p></div><button class=\"w-12 h-6 flex items-center rounded-full p-1 transition-colors duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-pink-600\"><div class=\"bg-white w-4 h-4 rounded-full shadow-md transform transition-transform duration-200 translate-x-6\"></div></button></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white\">Viewer Downloads</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Allow guests to save high-res media</p></div><button class=\"w-12 h-6 flex items-center rounded-full p-1 transition-colors duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-pink-600\"><div class=\"bg-white w-4 h-4 rounded-full shadow-md transform transition-transform duration-200 translate-x-6\"></div></button></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#0b0f19] border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg> Watermark &amp; Studio Branding</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white\">Apply Watermark on Guest Screen</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Protects studio photos from unauthorized reuse</p></div><button class=\"w-12 h-6 flex items-center rounded-full p-1 transition-colors duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-indigo-600\"><div class=\"bg-white w-4 h-4 rounded-full shadow-md transform transition-transform duration-200 translate-x-6\"></div></button></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Watermark Display Text / Studio Signature</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Captured by Royal Wedding Studio\" class=\"w-full bg-[#030712] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\" value=\"\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#0b0f19] border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-image w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21\"></path></svg> Live Feed Moderation</h2><span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">0<!-- --> Media items</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Click on the Eye button to instantly hide/unhide any photo from the guest viewer screen.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 max-h-96 overflow-y-auto pr-2\"></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#0b0f19] border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock w-4 h-4 text-amber-400\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Viewer Access Mode</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><button class=\"w-1/2 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border transition cursor-pointer bg-emerald-500/10 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-400\">Public (Open)</button><button class=\"w-1/2 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border transition cursor-pointer bg-slate-900 border-slate-800 text-slate-400\">PIN Protected</button></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#0b0f19] border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette w-4 h-4 text-pink-500\"><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\